OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry, breezy and rather
OL,6,Fcold with sunny spells, especially in
OL,7,Fthe north and east. A few wintry
OL,8,Fshowers affect eastern coasts and
OL,9,Fhills. Windy in the southwest, with
OL,10,Fheavy rain in places and possible
OL,11,Fcoastal gales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear spells in the north and
OL,14,Feast with a frost developing. Rain
OL,15,Facross the southwest, heavy at times,
OL,16,Fgradually easing and becoming patchier
OL,17,Fthrough the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
