OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCold start with frost and
OL,6,Fpatchy fog in places. Largely dry for
OL,7,Fmany but rain returns to western areas
OL,8,Flater. Breezy in the west, feeling
OL,9,Fcold for most places.
